<title>MEXICO: Ceramic first half net down. [CORRECTED 19:10 GMT]</title>
<headline>Ceramic first half net down. [CORRECTED 19:10 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects title from profit vs loss and all figures which were for 1996 and 1995).</p>
<p>				6 mo. 1997		   6 mo. 1996</p>
<p>	Shr			    n/a			n/a</p>
<p>	Net profit	   36.65 million		92.8 million</p>
<p>	Revs		  692.01 million	     626.49 million</p>
